VVAALLIIDD NNAAMMEESS
       The following characters are valid for VG and LV names: aa‐‐zz AA‐‐ZZ 00‐‐99 ++ __
       .. ‐‐

       VG and LV names cannot begin with a hyphen.  There are also various re‐
       served names that are used internally by lvm that can not be used as LV
       or  VG  names.   A VG cannot be called anything that exists in /dev/ at
       the time of creation, nor can it be called ’.’ or ’..’.  A LV cannot be
       called ’.’ ’..’ ’snapshot’ or ’pvmove’. The LV name may also  not  con‐
       tain the strings ’_mlog’ or ’_mimage’



